**Evaluating media tests**

I think we must be careful here. The existing media resolver test might fail due to the aspect ratio if it's clamped, but it seems like an aspect of 2 is unaffected, which is good news. I’ll need to add a widget test in the wenz_rich_text_editor test. It might also help to check if any overflow errors are being captured since Flutter tests can fail on overflow, possibly due to a test binding exception. I can assert that tester.takeException is null.
