**Fixing unnecessary casts**

I realize I need to fix an unnecessary cast on line 7778, where it casts `_safeVideoAspectRatio` as double. Instead, I could just use `toDouble()` directly, which seems more efficient. It's a pretty straightforward change, but realizing it means I have to patch the code. I hope removing that cast improves clarity and functionality. These little fixes really add up, so I’m glad to catch this!
